JEH DY CHOOILLEY HORCH NY KEAYRTYN HONNICK SHIN

211
00:13:01,379 --> 00:13:05,100
BALJYN BEGGEY NY CASSYN AYM UGHTAR CRINK EAYNAGH

212
00:13:05,399 --> 00:13:07,710
JEAN LHEID AS TA SHIN FAKIN AYNS SHENN

213
00:13:07,710 --> 00:13:12,179
LIOARYN AALIN NY KEAYRTYN VA SHIN VRIE LIORISH

214
00:13:12,269 --> 00:13:15,990
AWINYN AYNS STROOANYN VA JUAN LESH YN NOA

215
00:13:16,019 --> 00:13:19,199
LHEAN CLAGHAGH ER DAGH CHEU JEU DY VE

216
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,850
CURRIT DA THOOILLAGHYN MOOAREY

217
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:25,110
TA FEME ER MOOARANE USHTEY AS EH ROIE

218
00:13:25,110 --> 00:13:28,350
DY NIARTAL DY SKEABEY GLEN YN ARD MOOIE

219
00:13:28,350 --> 00:13:29,070
JEH AWIN

220
00:13:31,710 --> 00:13:34,590
DAGH STASHOON VA POSSANYN DY LEIH DY KEAYRTYN

221
00:13:34,590 --> 00:13:38,039
CHONNALYN AS OCSYN CEAU DY CHOOILLEY HORCH DY

222
00:13:38,039 --> 00:13:38,519
EADDAGH

223
00:13:39,690 --> 00:13:41,939
VA PAART JEU KIART GOLLRISH NY BODDEE AYNS

224
00:13:41,940 --> 00:13:45,030
Y CHEER AIN HENE NY GOLLROOSYN HONNICK MEE

225
00:13:45,029 --> 00:13:46,799
CHOUDS VA MEE CHEET TROOID Y RANK AS

226
00:13:46,799 --> 00:13:51,600
Y GHERMAAN LESH JAGGADYN GIAREY LIEHCHROOIN AS COOISHYN

227
00:13:51,779 --> 00:13:53,040
JEANT SY THIE OC HENE

228
00:13:54,389 --> 00:13:58,080
AGH VA PAART ELLEY JEU FEER CHASLYSSAGH VA

229
00:13:58,080 --> 00:14:01,950
NY MRAANE JEEAGHYN AALIN MOGHREY ROW USHTET FAGGYS

230
00:14:01,950 --> 00:14:06,000
DOU AGH V'AD FEER NEUYESH MYGEAYRT DY VOIN

231
00:14:07,529 --> 00:14:12,269
OCSYN OOILLEY EEYNLANN BANE JEH CRONT ENNAGH NY

232
00:14:12,269 --> 00:14:15,299
CRINK ELLEY AS EC YN CHOOID SMOO JEU

233
00:14:15,539 --> 00:14:19,649
VA CRED-IN MOOAREY LESH PALCHEY SCHEIMEIG JARROODAGH BENNALT

234
00:14:19,649 --> 00:14:23,340
VOU GOLLRISH NY GOONYN AYNS BALLEY AGH SON

235
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:24,899
SHICKYRYS VA OASHYRYN FO

236
00:14:26,519 --> 00:14:30,389
NY FEER SCHLEI HONNICK SHIN NY SMOO MAC

237
00:14:30,389 --> 00:14:30,569
YEE

238
00:14:31,769 --> 00:14:34,500
MAD NY SMOO BAYRN BRAGHTAN DY FUILLEE ELLEY

239
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:38,819
NISH NEE MOOAREY GUILLEY BAA OC COOISHYN MOOAREY

240
00:14:38,820 --> 00:14:43,620
LIGGAR BANN SOLLAGH AS CRIDEAN FEERVOOAR TROME YIARE

241
00:14:44,159 --> 00:14:48,299
BUNNYS TRIE ER HEROD TAGGIT OOILLEY HARRISH LESH

242
00:14:48,299 --> 00:14:49,559
TREINAGHYN PRASH

243
00:14:50,789 --> 00:14:53,879
V'AD CEAU BOOTSYN ARJEY AS NY TROOSYN AGH

244
00:14:53,879 --> 00:14:57,629
FILLIT STIAGH AYNDOO AS VA FOLK YOUR DOO

245
00:14:57,629 --> 00:14:59,550
OC DYS FAVOUR TROME DOO

246
00:15:01,289 --> 00:15:04,200
T'AD FEER CHASLYSSAGH AGH CHA NEL OO JEE

247
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:08,009
YN TAITNYSSAGH ER YN ARD UN VEAGH COONTEY

248
00:15:08,009 --> 00:15:11,400
JEANT JEU MOGHREY SHENN PHOSSAN ENNAGH DOORAGHTYN GHEAY

249
00:15:11,399 --> 00:15:15,299
NIAR AGH TA SLEIH GINSH DOU DY VALLEY

250
00:15:15,299 --> 00:15:18,120
GYN SKIELLEY AS LACCAL COOID VEG DY GHAANYS

251
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:20,310
DOOGHYSSAGH AYNS GOLL ROISH EU HENE

252
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:25,470
ER CHEU DORRAGHEY HEERAGH VE TRA REN SHIN

253
00:15:25,470 --> 00:15:28,889
BEE STREETS TA NY HIARN BOAYL FEER ANAASAGH

254
00:15:29,730 --> 00:15:32,340
AS EH BUNNYS KIART EC Y CHAGLIAGH SON

255
00:15:32,340 --> 00:15:34,680
DUNVERYN E VOIR GOLL GOLL DYS BULGARIA NA

256
00:15:35,490 --> 00:15:38,699
TA LANE FEER STERRYMAGH ER VE ECHEY AS

257
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:41,310
SON SHICKYRYS T'EH SOILSHAGHEY MAGH COWRAGHYN JEU

258
00:15:42,659 --> 00:15:45,570
JEIH BLEEANEY AS DAEED ER DY HENNEY VA

259
00:15:45,570 --> 00:15:49,589
STRAIH DY AINLEYN MOOAR AYN REN CRAGH AGLAGH

260
00:15:49,710 --> 00:15:51,059
QUOOID KEAYRT NY YEI

261
00:15:52,350 --> 00:15:55,439
ER DTY HOSHIAGHT DY HIAGHTOO CHEADOO JEIG REN

262
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:58,740
NY SURRANSE LIORISH CHIONNEY STIAGH RISH TREE SHIAGHTEEYN

263
00:15:59,460 --> 00:16:02,850
AS HIE MEE TREEJEIG THOUSANE DY LEIH NISH

264
00:16:02,850 --> 00:16:05,009
GAELG DOOAR CHAGGEY HENE GOLL ER JANNOO NY

265
00:16:05,009 --> 00:16:08,490
SHLEE ER COONTEY GORTEY AS DOGHAN

266
00:17:53,549 --> 00:17:58,559
PAART JEH'N CHIED LIOAR LIORISH BRYMSTONE AYNS CHYNDAA

267
00:17:58,559 --> 00:17:59,730
SON CLAARE NY GAEL

268
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:03,599
AS SHENNAGHYS SHOH AS MY SALLISH ABBYR SHEN

269
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:04,019
REESHT

